{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922044935_5356e005","chunk_index":21,"job_id":"mwjob_cffd00bfa3697e3b95523084","precondition_digest":"f483172f30b055a8b1e1a0031ff9bcf82f903ed2e0e2f5846600e2e4c3920808","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v8","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922044935_5356e005","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"避孕的规定与方法","missing_source_classes":["当前项目避孕与妊娠管理实施规定（可接受避孕方法、避孕持续时间及适用人群）","研究药物生殖毒理学资料及研究者手册","妊娠监测、妊娠报告与随访流程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实：目标人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者，入选年龄≥18岁；排除妊娠或哺乳期女性；双盲治疗期为16周，安全性随访期为4周。允许来源未提供本项目的避孕方法、避孕持续时间、适用受试者范围及妊娠监测与报告安排，本章无法据现有来源写出具体避孕规定。需医学作者会同临床与法规职能确认避孕及妊娠管理要求后补充。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（避孕的规定与方法）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","section_number":"14.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3c2ae205499223fa8cb96056","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922044935_5356e005","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:3c2ae205499223fa8cb96056","quote":"章节编号=14.2\n章节标题=研究量表和评价工具","quote_sha256":"66291c80a55f37bc539823c44797c04041288a0c0fdd046f17721446e15e0b74","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:3c2ae205499223fa8cb96056","span_id":"sp_sec_14_2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_pasi_timepoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_endpoints_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_endpoints_secondary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_dlqi"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"e97da70f0c9a5d6f604a29b6c054d0ed03fc9fd60470293f55ab4afbebddcff0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_adherence"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_sec_14_2","sp_pasi_timepoints","sp_endpoints_primary","sp_endpoints_secondary","sp_dlqi","sp_safety_endpoints","sp_adherence"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"研究量表和评价工具","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用PASI、sPGA和DLQI作为疗效评价工具。PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价；第16周PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）为主要终点，第16周PASI 90应答及第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级为关键次要终点。DLQI用于评价皮肤病相关生活质量，分析第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。安全性评价工具包括实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图，评价其具有临床意义的变化；受试者依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。","rationale":"已确认事实：PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；第16周PASI 75应答为主要终点；第16周PASI 90应答及第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级为关键次要终点；DLQI用于评价皮肤病相关生活质量，分析第16周较基线变化；安全性评价涵盖实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。需医学作者核对各量表的版本、中文版授权、评分培训与质量控制要求，以及DLQI的具体采集安排。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3c2ae205499223fa8cb96056","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922044935_5356e005","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"实验室检查项目","missing_source_classes":["当前项目实验室检查项目清单与采样时间表","研究者手册及非临床、临床安全性资料","实验室检查异常临床意义判定标准与报告流程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实：实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化纳入安全性终点，用于支持安全性评价。允许来源未列明实验室检查的具体项目、采样时点、样本处理及异常临床意义判定标准，本章无法据现有来源形成检查项目清单。需医学作者结合研究药物安全性特征与实验室手册确认后补充。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","section_number":"14.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3c2ae205499223fa8cb96056","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922044935_5356e005","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"安全信息报告途径","missing_source_classes":["当前项目安全性信息报告流程与报告时限","不良事件及严重不良事件定义、分级与因果关系判定标准","药物警戒职责分工与安全性数据管理要求","向监管机构、伦理委员会及申办方的报告路径"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实：安全性信息包括治疗期间出现的不良事件、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件；双盲治疗期为16周，第20周进行安全性随访。允许来源未规定安全性信息的报告途径、报告对象、报告时限及药物警戒职责分工，本章无法据现有来源写出具体报告流程。需医学作者与药物警戒职能确认后补充。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（安全信息报告途径）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4","section_number":"14.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3c2ae205499223fa8cb96056","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_wind